    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Add Facebook customerchat, Facebook messenger box or another widget chat to your website (tawk.to, subiz.vn). Easily custom your style for chat.</p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"[echbay.com] - Facebook Customerchat active for WordPress\" width=\"750\" height=\"563\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_YRVt3XLseA?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload <code>echbay-fb-messenger</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the <code>Plugins</code> admin menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Go to menu <code>Webgiare Plugins</code> menu and <code>Facebook Messenger</code> menu in WordPress for custom setting.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>Version 1.2.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update code for fb customer chat</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.2.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update code for subiz</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.2.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Support for primary code by webgiare.org</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.2.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove facebook form this plugin</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.2.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>defer for js loader</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.2.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Support custom language for facebook customchat</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.2.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed data null</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed for facebook custom CSS</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.1.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed get current time</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.1.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Save last click in tab</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.1.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Support subiz v4</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.1.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Facebook Customerchat</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.1.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>UhChat ID</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Load now</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Up for WP 4.9</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>None</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom Facebook app ID and update multi lang for facebook script</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.0.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update custom time for load widget chat</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.0.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update custom header title for mobile</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.0.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Width for fb-page interger only</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.0.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update for jQuery 3.2.1</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Support another chat widget</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update menu global for webgiare plugin</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>update for iPhone, iPad&#8230;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>optimize code content on plugin</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update CSS</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>None</li>\n</ul>\n"
